{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260ecxkuXzUa1794841383.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>商務部表示，支持德國車廠寶馬集團在華發展。</p><p></p><p>商務部副部長凌激在北京會見寶馬集團新任董事長聶科維。</p><p></p><p>凌激指出，中國持續優化營商環境，提振消費信心，支持包括寶馬在內的外資車企在華發展，而中歐貿易投資磋商機制，第二次例會達成一系列成果共識，為中歐企業合作提供了穩定預期，希望寶馬加大在華研發力度，為中國消費者提供更加多樣化、高品質的產品和服務。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CAR-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LJSwldHhW61794841414.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>聶科維表示，中國是寶馬全球市場的重要組成部分，將擴大在華投資和創新研發，不斷提高供應鏈本地化水平，願在歐中經貿關係中貢獻正能量。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:39:53.024851+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:41.542881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:33:14.083291+00:00","content_hash":"6049898216c962a4b53e84710e21b094480151e606048ce790d18da3d5eb1b0b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:39:53.024851+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}